    "long_instructions": "## Make: Custom Calculator\r\n\r\nUse your plan to program a custom calculator that:\r\n\r\n* asks the user for input\r\n* converts inputs to the correct data type using `str()`, `int()`, or `float()`\r\n* uses a formula with arithmetic operators \r\n* prints a clear result with units and user guidance\r\n",
